  "_notes": "M1's 10 events (DECISIONS A62). One object per event, keyed evt_eNN_name (A54). trigger.kind picks the rule: monthly, review, lease, after_raise, chain (a telegraphed chain), resizing, random, incident. requires: employed, remote, rto, home_min, tip, clause, not_flag, deadline_or_incident_days. effects: mo, burnout, codebase, skill, rust, savings (k$), living_mult, commute_burnout, speed_mod {mult, days}, hours_lock {notch, days}, flags, work_mode, action. exhausted_choice names the choice a burnt-out you takes (A66), or none. ducky.tip is a tip id or none (O7). The draft copy awaits the developer's tone and tip sign-off (CONTENT 16).",
